# MEVIS Production Environment Variables

## Context Service (`services/context-service`)

| Variable        | Default       | Required | Description |
|----------------|---------------|----------|-------------|
| `NODE_ENV`     | `development` | Yes      | Set to `production` |
| `PORT`         | `3008`        | No       | HTTP server port |
| `DB_URL`       | `./mevis.db`  | Yes*     | Path to SQLite DB file. For Railway: `/data/mevis.db` |
| `LOG_LEVEL`    | `info`        | No       | `debug`, `info`, `warn`, `error` |

## Gateway (`services/gateway`)

| Variable               | Default | Required | Description |
|-----------------------|---------|----------|-------------|
| `NODE_ENV`            | `development` | Yes | Set to `production` |
| `PORT`                | `8000`  | No       | HTTP server port |
| `LOG_LEVEL`           | `info`  | No       | Logging level |
| `CONTEXT_SERVICE_URL` | —       | Yes      | Internal URL to context-service (e.g., `http://context-service:3008`) |

## Dashboard Frontend (`apps/dashboard`)

| Variable                        | Description |
|--------------------------------|-------------|
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTEXT_SERVICE_URL` | Public URL to the context-service (e.g., Railway URL) |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_URL`      | Public URL to the gateway (e.g., Railway URL) |

## GitHub Actions Secrets Required

| Secret             | Description |
|-------------------|-------------|
| `VERCEL_TOKEN`    | Vercel API token (Settings → Tokens) |
| `RAILWAY_TOKEN`   | Railway API token (Account Settings → Tokens) |

## GitHub Actions Variables Required

| Variable               | Description |
|-----------------------|-------------|
| `CONTEXT_SERVICE_URL` | Public URL of deployed context-service |
| `GATEWAY_URL`         | Public URL of deployed gateway |
